= CoworkingView Prices =

Macro id: coworkingview. Extension id: com.coworkingview:coworkingview-macro.

{{{
{{coworkingview city="berlin"/}}
}}}

{{{
{{coworkingview city="berlin" limit="3"/}}
}}}

The macro sends one GET to [[https://api.coworkingview.com/v1/market/rates?locale=en&city=berlin]] (the city slug replaces berlin). It prints a table, the attribution string from the response, and a link to [[https://coworkingview.com]].

Parameters: city (required slug) and limit (optional, 1 to 50, display only).

Programming rights are required. See [[CoworkingView.WebHome]].
